{"id":"0bf7676225746ee2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-change-set.md","title":"原书改变集与计数编码变体","display":"df-change-set — 原书改变集与计数编码变体","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-change-set","aliases":["20-df-change-set"],"display":"df-change-set — 原书改变集与计数编码变体","chapter":"3","section":"3.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 3.6.4 的原式；计数变体及双向转换为本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[104],"source_printed_pages":[68],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-teq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-change-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-change-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-change-set — 原书改变集与计数编码变体"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.6.4 的原式；计数变体及双向转换为本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>104</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\omega^2\\to2\">\\(a:\\omega^2\\to2\\)</span> 全可计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x,0)=0\">\\(a(x,0)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\">\\(a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\\)</span>。配对代码的两个坐标次序在下文分别明确；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{future}\">\\(\\mathrm{future}\\)</span> 是来源改变集的字面名称标签，不是额外参数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}change\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nC_a^{\\mathrm{future}}:=\\{\\langle s,x\\rangle:\\exists t&gt;s\\ [a(x,s)\\ne a(x,t)]\\},\\\\\nc_a(x,s):=|\\{t&lt;s:a(x,t+1)\\ne a(x,t)\\}|,\\qquad\nC_a:=\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle:\\exists s\\ [n&lt;c_a(x,s)]\\},\\\\\nc_a(x,\\infty):=\\lim_s c_a(x,s),\\qquad\n\\chi_A(x)=c_a(x,\\infty)\\bmod2,\\\\\nC_a^{\\mathrm{future}},C_a\\in\\mathcal E,\\qquad C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\\equiv_T C_a.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}change\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nC_a^{\\mathrm{future}}:=\\{\\langle s,x\\rangle:\\exists t&gt;s\\ [a(x,s)\\ne a(x,t)]\\},\\\\\nc_a(x,s):=|\\{t&lt;s:a(x,t+1)\\ne a(x,t)\\}|,\\qquad\nC_a:=\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle:\\exists s\\ [n&lt;c_a(x,s)]\\},\\\\\nc_a(x,\\infty):=\\lim_s c_a(x,s),\\qquad\n\\chi_A(x)=c_a(x,\\infty)\\bmod2,\\\\\nC_a^{\\mathrm{future}},C_a\\in\\mathcal E,\\qquad C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\\equiv_T C_a.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.6.4 定义的是第一行：当前阶段的值将来还会变化，坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle s,x\\rangle\\)</span>；这个定义不要求初值为 0。旧稿只给了第二行的改变次数编码，却标为原书原式。本条恢复原式，并保留下游 omega-ce 已使用的计数接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a\">\\(C_a\\)</span>，将其明确标为本地变体。初值 0 仅供这里的奇偶恢复公式；一般初值时结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)=(a(x,0)+c_a(x,\\infty))\\bmod2\">\\(\\chi_A(x)=(a(x,0)+c_a(x,\\infty))\\bmod2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每个输入有限次改变，故极限计数存在。对阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 归纳，每次改变恰翻转二值且增加计数 1，不改变时两者都不变，证明奇偶公式。两个改变集的成员性都有可计算的有限见证，因此均 c.e.。</p>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a\">\\(C_a\\)</span> oracle，搜索首个不在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 计数列中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，得到全部改变次数；再模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x,\\cdot)\">\\(a(x,\\cdot)\\)</span> 至累计次数达到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的阶段，此后永远不变。检查这段有限历史便能决定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,x)\">\\((s,x)\\)</span> 是否还会在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 以后改变，即算出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\">\\(C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时初始阶段已经稳定。反向给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\">\\(C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\\)</span> oracle，搜索首个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle s,x\\rangle\\)</span> 不属于它，因逐点稳定而停止；所有改变都发生在不晚于该阶段的位置，有限模拟求出总次数，便可决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a\">\\(C_a\\)</span> 的成员。两种接口的同度关系有独立算法，不以它们都称作改变集来推断。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.6.4；印刷 68 / PDF 104；计数形式及同度转换为本地展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-teq]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-teq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-teq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-teq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-teq]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a:\\omega^2\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"a(x,0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{future}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}change\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nC_a^{\\mathrm{future}}:=\\{\\langle s,x\\rangle:\\exists t>s\\ [a(x,s)\\ne a(x,t)]\\},\\\\\nc_a(x,s):=|\\{t<s:a(x,t+1)\\ne a(x,t)\\}|,\\qquad\nC_a:=\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle:\\exists s\\ [n<c_a(x,s)]\\},\\\\\nc_a(x,\\infty):=\\lim_s c_a(x,s),\\qquad\n\\chi_A(x)=c_a(x,\\infty)\\bmod2,\\\\\nC_a^{\\mathrm{future}},C_a\\in\\mathcal E,\\qquad C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}\\equiv_T C_a.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle s,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"C_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(x)=(a(x,0)+c_a(x,\\infty))\\bmod2","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"C_a","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"a(x,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"(s,x)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"C_a^{\\mathrm{future}}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"C_a","display":false}],"bytes":2960,"backlinks":[{"id":"c209552a90f2623f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-change-set]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-change-set]] — 章 3；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-change-set]]"}],"outgoing":["ea4f6c0d21b23194","35073b74f84433b3","60af447f5d59a8dc","3dd875417abdd49f"]}